---
interface Props { compact?: boolean }
const {compact=false}=Astro.props;
const plans=[
  {hours:'20',price:'$999',name:'Creative assistance',fit:'For existing Ashbi identity clients with a smaller, steady list of needs.',includes:['A monthly priority list','Design and development tasks within the agreed hours','One shared review and feedback flow'],note:'Available to existing Ashbi identity clients'},
  {hours:'40',price:'$1,999',name:'Creative support',fit:'For growing teams with regular campaigns, content, or website updates.',includes:['A monthly planning conversation','Design and development tasks within the agreed hours','A clear queue and agreed review points'],note:'A flexible ongoing partnership'},
  {hours:'80',price:'$3,999',name:'Creative partnership',fit:'For teams with a larger, continuous stream of creative and digital work.',includes:['A dedicated monthly plan','Design and development tasks within the agreed hours','Priority scheduling agreed in advance'],note:'For sustained creative capacity'},
];
---
<section class:list={['ongoing-plans',{'ongoing-plans-compact':compact}]} aria-labelledby={compact?'ongoing-detail-heading':'ongoing-heading'} id={compact?'ongoing-options':'ongoing-pricing'}>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="ongoing-intro"><div><span class="eyebrow">ONGOING SUPPORT / MONTHLY PRICING</span><h2 id={compact?'ongoing-detail-heading':'ongoing-heading'}>Good work keeps <em>moving.</em></h2></div><p>When the next request is already on its way, choose a level of monthly creative capacity that fits your team. We confirm priorities, deliverables, and availability together before work begins.</p></div>
    <div class="ongoing-grid">{plans.map((plan,index)=><article class="ongoing-card reveal">
      <div class="ongoing-card-top"><span>0{index+1} / 03</span><span>MONTHLY CAPACITY</span></div>
      <div class="ongoing-hours"><strong>{plan.hours}</strong><span>hours<br />per month</span></div>
      <h3>{plan.name}</h3><p class="ongoing-fit">{plan.fit}</p>
      <p class="ongoing-price"><strong>{plan.price}</strong><span> / month</span></p>
      <ul>{plan.includes.map(item=><li>{item}</li>)}</ul>
      <p class="ongoing-note">{plan.note}</p>
      <a href="/contact/?service=design-and-dev-subscription#project-brief">Discuss this option <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </article>)}</div>
    <div class="ongoing-bottom"><p>Need a different cadence or a larger one-off build? We’ll shape a separate scope around it. The final hours, deliverables, timing, and fee are confirmed in your proposal.</p><a class="text-link" href={compact?'/contact/?service=design-and-dev-subscription#project-brief':'/services/design-and-dev-subscription/'}>{compact?'Tell us what you need ↗':'Explore ongoing support ↗'}</a></div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .ongoing-plans{background:var(--ink);color:#fff;padding:clamp(76px,8vw,126px) 0}
  .ongoing-intro{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;gap:clamp(22px,6vw,86px);align-items:end;margin-bottom:42px}
  .ongoing-intro .eyebrow{color:var(--lime)}
  .ongoing-intro h2{font-size:clamp(2.8rem,5.5vw,5.7rem);line-height:1.02;margin:18px 0 0}
  .ongoing-intro h2 em{color:var(--lime)}
  .ongoing-intro>p{max-width:530px;color:#d8def0;font-size:1.08rem;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 5px}
  .ongoing-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:16px}
  .ongoing-card{display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-width:0;padding:clamp(24px,3vw,36px);border-radius:24px;background:#f7f8f5;color:var(--ink);border:1px solid #f7f8f5}
  .ongoing-card:nth-child(2){background:var(--lime);border-color:var(--lime)}
  .ongoing-card-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;font-size:.67rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.12em}
  .ongoing-hours{display:flex;align-items:end;gap:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #b9c2c5;margin:27px 0 24px;padding-bottom:22px}
  .ongoing-hours strong{font-size:clamp(4.4rem,8vw,7.5rem);font-weight:700;line-height:.78;letter-spacing:-.09em}
  .ongoing-hours span{font-size:.76rem;line-height:1.25;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.08em}
  .ongoing-card h3{font-size:clamp(1.65rem,2.5vw,2.5rem);line-height:1.05;margin:0 0 16px}
  .ongoing-fit{font-size:.92rem;line-height:1.5;min-height:5.7em;color:#454d62;margin:0 0 22px}
  .ongoing-price{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:4px;margin:0 0 26px}
  .ongoing-price strong{font-size:clamp(2rem,3vw,3rem);line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.05em}
  .ongoing-price span{font-size:.78rem;font-weight:700}
  .ongoing-card ul{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0 0 24px;display:grid;gap:12px}
  .ongoing-card li{position:relative;padding-left:22px;font-size:.84rem;line-height:1.45}
  .ongoing-card li:before{content:'✓';position:absolute;left:0;font-weight:800}
  .ongoing-note{font-size:.69rem;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;border-top:1px solid #b9c2c5;margin:auto 0 19px;padding-top:17px}
  .ongoing-card>a{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;align-items:center;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;padding:15px 18px;border-radius:100px;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:.7rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.04em}
  .ongoing-card>a:focus-visible,.ongoing-bottom a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--lime);outline-offset:4px}
  .ongoing-bottom{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:32px;margin-top:26px}
  .ongoing-bottom p{max-width:750px;color:#d8def0;font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.55;margin:0}
  .ongoing-bottom a{flex:none;color:var(--lime)}
  .ongoing-plans-compact{margin-top:0}
  @media(max-width:900px){.ongoing-intro{grid-template-columns:1fr}.ongoing-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.ongoing-card:last-child{grid-column:1/-1}.ongoing-fit{min-height:0}}
  @media(max-width:620px){.ongoing-plans{padding:70px 0}.ongoing-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.ongoing-card:last-child{grid-column:auto}.ongoing-bottom{display:block}.ongoing-bottom a{display:inline-block;margin-top:20px}.ongoing-hours strong{font-size:6rem}}
</style>
